# Single-page app: go_router paths (/library, /book/123, ...) have no file of
# their own, so any path that is not a real file serves the app's index.html and
# the router takes over. Cloudflare Pages and Netlify only apply a rewrite (200)
# when no static file matches, so real files such as main.dart.wasm are
# served as themselves.
/*  /index.html  200
